  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Panyimur Dei ACE Rice Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to improve incomes of smallholder farmers by increasing the quantity and quality of rice produced and marketed. Farmers are organized in Rural Producer Organisations(RPOs) that collectively market their rice to increase bargaining power.</narrative>
  </description>
